  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 cups bread flour",
    "1 cup water",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "1.5 teaspoons bread machine yeast",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "cooking spray",
    "1 egg yolk",
    "1 tablespoon water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place flour, 1 cup water, sugar, yeast, and salt into a bread machine pan in the order recommended by manufacturer. Select Dough cycle; press Start.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DfHB6w6tEwbHoRwev_V4DFEJwNU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7028-french-baguette-ddmfs-step-01-106460fec5b24477b7be01e2a6793c65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7028/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the cycle is running, grease a bowl and cookie sheet with cooking spray; set them aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "When the cycle is complete, place dough in the greased bowl, turning to coat all sides.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5xOe6J1P1HmM-Alm0seuuwrIvtI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7028-french-baguette-ddmfs-step-02-202b249f7e2243d78df7ce5966ec931c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7028/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and let rise in a warm place until doubled in size, about 30 minutes. Dough is ready if indentation remains when touched.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qy4Huk-4L4LrgatEcvvDMzaByj4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7028-french-baguette-ddmfs-step-04-6d2ac9a6ba2f44fda108dfe7878098dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7028/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punch down dough and transfer to a lightly floured surface. Roll into a 16-x12-inch rectangle. Cut dough in half, creating two 8-x12-inch rectangles. Roll up each half of dough tightly, beginning at a long side, pounding out any air bubbles as you go. Roll gently back and forth to taper ends.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dlzWCewthiz39_XctlFt9ey5FjA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7028-french-baguette-ddmfs-step-06-443f9856c6ad4d01a9dde68c1babaa28.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7028/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 3 inches apart on the greased cookie sheet. Make deep diagonal slashes across loaves every 2 inches or one lengthwise slash on each loaf. Cover and let rise in a warm place until doubled in size, 30 to 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SSZqhl8oM2zS1u2BbFevmykvw9w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7028-french-baguette-ddmfs-step-07-9b3f123f68724addbe0a485791dbe9b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7028/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix egg yolk with 1 tablespoon water in a small bowl; brush over tops of loaves.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dZQ8tIAIXsRUm-MDT2QjjzNTs4g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7028-french-baguette-ddmfs-step-08-c920e294fab34d9891eeed85a633b07e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7028/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J96_s7wY7k0vQtMZ9l5_XQZn4cg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/7028-french-baguettes-DDMFS-4x3-a3f7e7cc53654c8db2c9919148e7c915.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7028/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
